=== Dragon's Gate ===
The Dragon's Gate is the entrance to the '''Dragon's Nest'''. During [[Ender Dragon]] fights, the Gate closes, and players must deal damage to it for it to open. Entering through the Dragon's Gate will lead the player to a set of stairs, which lead to the floor of the '''Dragon's Nest'''. Underneath the stairs is the {{zone|Void Slate}}, containing various other features.

