=== Dragon's Altar ===
{{For|the feature that allows players to sacrifice End-related gear|Draconic Altar}}
The Dragon's Altar is a structure in the center of the '''Dragon's Nest'''. It features {{Green|8}} [[End Portal Frame]]s. Once the Dragon Egg spawns, players can place [[Summoning Eye]]s in order to summon a [[Ender Dragon|Dragon]]. Once a [[Summoning Eye]] is placed, a [[Sleeping Eye]] will appear in the player's inventory, acting as a placeholder. Players who placed a [[Summoning Eye]] can retrieve it at any time, to revert the [[Sleeping Eye]] back to a [[Summoning Eye]], unless a [[Ender Dragon|Dragon]] has already been spawned.

Once {{Green|8}} [[Summoning Eye]]s are placed, a beam goes up along the glass, and the Dragon Egg hatches to summon a dragon, disappearing when the boss is spawned. After hatching, the Dragon Egg structure is destroyed, preventing another dragon from being summoned. The Dragon Egg respawns a minute after the Ender Dragon is defeated, allowing players to summon another dragon.

